# eyeball does not read a .env file and needs no secrets or API keys.
# No variable has to be set. This file exists only to say so.
#
# Variables eyeball itself reads:
#   NO_COLOR   Standard convention (https://no-color.org). Set to any value to turn off
#              the colors of the startup banner. The banner is also off when stderr is not a terminal.
#
# Variables used by a tool eyeball depends on (not read by eyeball code):
#   PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH   Playwright: where `npx playwright install chromium` puts the browser.
#
# The "auth" config field is a no-op placeholder: no cookie or token is read from the environment.
#
# NO_COLOR=1